WEBVTT

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:21.870
Hey, Nishi! Why aren't you hitting back, dammit!?

00:01:21.870 --> 00:01:22.560
Nishi!

00:01:27.610 --> 00:01:29.620
Nishi! Can't you hear me?

00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:31.610
30 seconds! There's only 30 seconds left!

00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:37.610
This'll be your third straight defeat!

00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:55.380
You idiot!

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:57.260
Why won't you fight like I tell you to?

00:01:57.260 --> 00:01:59.060
Why didn't you even try to punch him?

00:01:59.060 --> 00:02:03.390
Listen good! You could've beaten your opponent easily! You moron!

00:02:04.150 --> 00:02:05.890
I-I'm sorry...

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:07.570
Don't give me "I'm sorry"!

00:02:07.570 --> 00:02:10.060
Apologizing doesn't help anything, you coward!

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:10.860
I-I'm sorry!

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:12.010
You bastard!

00:02:15.220 --> 00:02:18.830
Yokel! Blockhead! Fish-eyes! Third-rate washout! Clumsy idiot!

00:02:18.830 --> 00:02:21.680
I don't care anymore! You should just quit boxing altogether!

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:25.120
Hey, don't you think you're going a little overboard, old man?

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:26.370
Shut up!

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:29.380
Listen, I don't know if that idiot even wants to...

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:34.630
Hey, Nishi!

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:36.930
Come on. Your match is coming up soon.

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:39.090
I'm going to be <i>very</i> thorough in my training sessions! Let's go!

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:42.410
But...

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:55.540
Hold on, old man.

00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:00.950
Nishi, what's with that getup?

00:03:02.090 --> 00:03:04.310
Th-Thank you...

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:05.910
for looking after me for so long.

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:11.220
I will be leaving this gym as of today.

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:12.650
Old man, Joe...

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:16.010
Please take care...

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:21.740
Take care...

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:24.970
H-Hey, Nishi!

00:03:25.490 --> 00:03:26.480
You've gotta be kidding!

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:27.360
Hey!

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:30.440
Hey, wait, Nishi!

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:31.320
Nishi, don't be hasty!

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:32.700
Wait up, dammit! Hold up!

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:33.900
Joe, let me go!

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:36.900
Nishi, I said wait!

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:41.910
Nishi, are you gonna abandon the Tange Gym...

00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:43.410
after all our hard work to get it to this level?

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:46.880
I'm just a burden to the Tange Gym.

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:48.370
I lack courage...

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:50.330
and I just end up causing you trouble.

00:03:53.570 --> 00:03:54.320
Nishi, you didn't answer my question!

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:55.920
Nishi, you didn't answer my question!

00:03:56.370 --> 00:03:58.920
Are you abandoning us, huh?

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:01.240
Are you gonna just walk away from all that we've built?

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:04.090
Well, are you?

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:04.930
Answer me, Nishi!

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:07.030
Don't make me say it, Joe!

00:04:07.030 --> 00:04:08.470
Don't make me say it!

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:29.410
He's crying...

00:04:36.110 --> 00:04:38.010
So this is the root of the problem.

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:40.850
Since he turned pro, he's lost all three of his matches.

00:04:40.850 --> 00:04:45.320
Anyone would have an inferiority complex when placed next to Joe's perfect record.

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:48.430
An inferiority complex, huh?

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:53.500
That's why we have to help Mammoth Nishi build up his confidence!

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:56.400
Why don't we go ask that doctor next door?

00:04:57.650 --> 00:05:01.250
He may not be a psychologist, but at least he's a doctor.

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:05.410
You guys are talking about some pretty grown-up stuff.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:18.270
But you're a physician, aren't you, Doctor?

00:05:18.270 --> 00:05:21.050
Can't you do some psychotherapy or whatever it's called?

00:05:24.270 --> 00:05:26.090
No doctor nor medicine
 can cure what ails him.

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:28.050
I should've known...

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:32.060
But encouraging words from a woman he likes may do the trick.

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:33.210
A woman?

00:05:34.820 --> 00:05:36.560
Hear that? He said "a woman"!

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:39.580
The warm encouragement of a woman he likes!

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:40.850
A woman, he says!

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:45.070
What a disgusting laugh.

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:49.570
But looking at Mammoth, I doubt he even knows that many women.

00:05:50.470 --> 00:05:52.080
No, wait!

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:52.900
What?

00:05:52.900 --> 00:05:54.610
I have someone in mind...

00:05:56.610 --> 00:05:58.080
Thanks for the food! I'll be off!

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:03.340
Take care, Noriko!

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:05.340
I'm home!

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:07.520
Welcome home, Noriko!

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:08.600
A wet towel?

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:10.880
Great work, Noriko.

00:06:12.030 --> 00:06:13.940
I'll walk with you, Noriko!

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:16.560
Be a little more careful!

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:18.820
I'm so sorry, Noriko.

00:06:21.670 --> 00:06:23.070
Good morning, Noriko!

00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:26.070
Take care, Noriko!

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:29.070
Th-That's not true, Noriko...

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:31.910
Noriko!

00:06:33.710 --> 00:06:34.740
See?

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:41.290
Bye! See you tomorrow!

00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:42.800
Oh?

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:43.820
Uh...

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:45.300
Miss Noriko...

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:51.810
U-Um, we have something to discuss with you...

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:54.770
What could it be? Don't leave me in suspense!

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:58.770
Oh, nothing major. Now, if you would accompany me to somewhere quieter...

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:00.310
It's about Nishi-kun?

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:03.280
Yeah, we wanted to know how you felt about him!

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:04.850
How I feel?

00:07:04.850 --> 00:07:06.610
Do you like him or not?

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:08.240
Well, I'd be lying if I said I didn't like him...

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:13.480
Great! That's our down-to-earth Noriko-chan!

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:20.290
The mammoth looks dimwitted on the outside, but inside, he has the warmth of a good man.

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:23.790
I knew that kinda man would be your ideal guy!

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:25.800
Congratulations!

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:28.800
Congratulations! We wish you both happiness!

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:31.530
You all came to make fun of me, didn't you?

00:07:31.530 --> 00:07:32.430
What horrid children!

00:07:33.310 --> 00:07:34.540
Huh?

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:35.590
Oh well.

00:07:36.210 --> 00:07:37.310
She got mad.

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:40.800
So, I guess Noriko-chan doesn't like Mammoth, after all.

00:07:40.800 --> 00:07:42.270
Does she like someone else, I wonder...

00:07:42.710 --> 00:07:44.770
Maybe she likes Joe?

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:48.620
No! Noriko-chan likes Mammoth!

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:50.780
She just got mad 'cause she's embarrassed!

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:52.780
That's a woman's heart for ya!

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:59.790
I have to tell Mammoth and encourage him!

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:01.790
Sachi, wait up!

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:05.790
Whaddya think?

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:12.260
Sachi likes Joe too, so she's probably just biased.

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:19.770
Excuse me!

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:24.510
I've come to talk about a woman's heart. This has nothing to do with you two.

00:08:34.720 --> 00:08:36.430
Mammoth?

00:08:36.430 --> 00:08:39.370
Mammoth-san, Noriko-chan's worried about you!

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:40.040
Noriko?

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:45.040
Yeah! She said she'll bring violets to your next match and cheer you on!

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:47.760
Noriko's bringing violets?

00:08:47.760 --> 00:08:50.250
Yeah! She said you have to be confident!

00:08:51.580 --> 00:08:52.800
Noriko said that?

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:54.300
Yup!

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:55.470
I see...

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:58.310
Everyone's really worried about you!

00:09:02.340 --> 00:09:03.520
C'mon!

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:06.560
Come on!

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:32.870
All right, that's the way!

00:09:32.870 --> 00:09:34.050
Step in a little!

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:41.560
F-Forgive me, Joe!

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:44.560
That was a pretty good bout, Nishi!

00:09:51.260 --> 00:09:54.740
At this rate, he'll have tomorrow's match in the bag!

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:58.580
As long as we do something about Noriko-chan...

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:01.580
No!

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:05.940
I've got a test tomorrow!

00:10:05.940 --> 00:10:08.080
I can't go and watch a boxing match!

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:11.770
B-But tomorrow's a big day for Mammoth!

00:10:11.770 --> 00:10:15.090
Enough! Do you think Nishi-kun and I are in some kind of relationship?

00:10:18.700 --> 00:10:21.400
Relax, guys! We'll think of something!

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:26.060
At any rate, tomorrow's a really important day for Mammoth!

00:10:33.990 --> 00:10:37.660
You've been practicing harder than ever, and you're losing weight pretty steadily.

00:10:37.660 --> 00:10:39.650
All right! You'll win this time for sure!

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:43.790
Yeah! We're counting on your tenacity!

00:10:43.790 --> 00:10:46.960
As long as you have that, you've as good as won!

00:10:56.850 --> 00:10:58.930
Trembling with excitement? That's great!

00:11:03.530 --> 00:11:04.390
What's wrong?

00:11:05.150 --> 00:11:06.040
I gotta piss.

00:11:13.430 --> 00:11:15.400
What's the matter, Nishi?

00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:26.150
What's wrong, Nishi?

00:11:27.400 --> 00:11:29.000
I can't... No matter what I do...

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.410
I can't... No matter what I do...

00:11:31.780 --> 00:11:32.460
Nishi!

00:11:33.230 --> 00:11:35.420
Whatever I do, I have no confidence in myself...

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:39.430
Nishi, do you realize how much everyone's worried about you?

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:43.010
Me, the old man, and the kids...

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:44.930
I know, but none of it is helping!

00:11:45.660 --> 00:11:46.930
Don't say that!

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:51.390
W-Well, I'll do what I have to...

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:53.400
That's the way! You can do it!

00:11:54.430 --> 00:11:57.400
B-But... there's one condition...

00:11:58.060 --> 00:11:59.400
A condition?

00:11:59.830 --> 00:12:00.840
Yeah...

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:04.900
What's this condition?

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:10.480
If I lose pathetically again, I'll quit.

00:12:10.480 --> 00:12:11.910
If I lose pathetically again, I'll quit.

00:12:12.760 --> 00:12:14.420
You'll quit boxing?

00:12:28.150 --> 00:12:29.410
I hear ya.

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:31.890
Must be hard living on the brink of humiliation all the time.

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:34.100
If you do quit, I won't try to stop you.

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:37.850
But you're not gonna lose, are you?

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:41.890
You <i>will</i> win!

00:12:42.810 --> 00:12:44.360
I'm sure of it!

00:13:09.370 --> 00:13:10.560
Mammoth!

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:13.560
Mammoth!

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:15.900
Noriko-chan will be here soon!

00:13:15.900 --> 00:13:17.230
So you'd better give it everything you've got!

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:34.390
What are you doing, Mammoth, you idiot!?

00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:35.630
Sachi sure is late...

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:37.810
Dodge! Dodge! Step back!

00:13:37.810 --> 00:13:39.120
Use your feet!

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:48.700
Hey, guys! I brought her!

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:51.680
Now, the rest is up to you! Make Mammoth hustle!

00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:54.370
You mean <i>he's</i> playing Noriko?

00:13:54.370 --> 00:13:57.230
Th-That red shawl and red neckerchief...

00:13:58.140 --> 00:14:04.230
How rude! I used to be a famous oyama kabuki actor, donchaknow! Now, if you'll excuse me...

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:11.200
Step back! Get your elbows up in your guard!

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:11.870
In your guard!

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:16.230
Go, Mammoth! Charge!

00:14:16.230 --> 00:14:17.580
Do your best! Noriko-chan's watching!

00:14:21.590 --> 00:14:23.980
Nishi! Watch your opponent and tighten up your strokes!

00:14:23.980 --> 00:14:24.590
Nishi!

00:14:25.310 --> 00:14:26.590
Break!

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:28.500
I'm so nervous I'm sweating...

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:31.090
Why can't he fight like he does in training?

00:14:31.090 --> 00:14:33.260
Hit the nail on the head!

00:14:35.880 --> 00:14:38.450
Do your job, dude!

00:14:38.450 --> 00:14:41.400
The girl told me I just had to sit here!

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:46.280
You're faster than he is. Ease up a little.

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:49.060
He's got a weak left. Your guard can block it.

00:14:49.060 --> 00:14:50.680
Then, hit him with a hard right!

00:14:50.680 --> 00:14:51.280
Got it?

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:53.600
And don't forget your footwork!

00:14:53.600 --> 00:14:54.370
Use your legs!

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:57.160
Here.

00:14:57.160 --> 00:14:58.100
Thanks!

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:03.170
Mammoth! You got this!

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:04.460
Go for it, Nishi!

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:06.180
C'mon, it's business time!

00:15:06.180 --> 00:15:08.470
Fine! I'll do it!

00:15:08.860 --> 00:15:11.510
Nishi! Do your best!

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:13.970
Go, Nishi! Use your legs!

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:21.860
Mammoth! Go get 'im!

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:29.570
Get your hands up, you idiot! Your hands!

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:37.330
Your legs! Don't stop, Mammoth! Keep moving, idiot!

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:41.980
Mammoth!

00:15:41.980 --> 00:15:44.340
What're you doing? Punch! Punch!

00:15:44.340 --> 00:15:47.840
Are you a scarecrow, you 
blockhead!? Punch him! Move!

00:16:04.680 --> 00:16:06.770
My legs just won't move!

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:09.860
B-Bonehead! Get up! Now!

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:11.480
Mammoth, hang in there!

00:16:11.480 --> 00:16:13.860
Noriko-chan's watching you!

00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:16.370
Mammoth! Get up!

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:27.380
N-Noriko!

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:29.800
N-Noriko!

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:36.320
I'll give it all I've got!

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:36.890
Fight!

00:16:47.830 --> 00:16:49.940
Oh, no! I can't move my arms!

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:52.110
Don't stop, you idiot!

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:54.280
Move! Use your legs! Nishi!

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:01.660
Clinch! Clinch him!

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:03.660
Run! Get around him! What are you doing?

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:17.970
You can do it!

00:17:22.880 --> 00:17:24.300
It's over...

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:39.260
I-I can't go on any longer...

00:17:39.260 --> 00:17:40.820
I'm sorry, Joe...

00:17:54.910 --> 00:17:59.150
N-Noriko and Joe, and the old man...

00:17:59.150 --> 00:18:00.330
Forgive me...

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:13.910
Let me be. I'm a coward.

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:16.150
I'm good for nothing.

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:19.020
Joe, old man, I'm sorry...

00:18:25.690 --> 00:18:26.560
Nishi...

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:29.960
You gonna let it end like this, Nishi?

00:18:30.490 --> 00:18:33.590
S-Stop counting already...

00:18:33.590 --> 00:18:35.220
It won't make any difference...

00:18:36.760 --> 00:18:37.900
Nishi... you're so...

00:18:37.900 --> 00:18:39.010
Nishi... you're so...

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:42.540
You gambled your whole future on this one match,

00:18:43.130 --> 00:18:45.430
and now you're just gonna disappear from our side?

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:47.330
Joe...

00:18:47.330 --> 00:18:49.940
Why do you look so scared?

00:18:50.820 --> 00:18:52.480
Just because of this one little match...

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:55.720
Just because of one little count...

00:18:55.720 --> 00:18:56.930
Nishi!

00:18:56.930 --> 00:18:58.090
Joe... are you crying?

00:18:58.090 --> 00:18:58.990
Joe... are you crying?

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:07.030
Joe!

00:19:07.030 --> 00:19:08.850
Joe's crying!

00:19:18.990 --> 00:19:20.400
Joe's crying... for me!

00:19:23.540 --> 00:19:25.340
Joe's crying... for me!

00:19:25.340 --> 00:19:27.870
He's crying for me!

00:19:27.870 --> 00:19:29.620
Joe's... Joe's...

00:19:29.620 --> 00:19:31.720
Joe's... Joe's...

00:19:31.720 --> 00:19:34.170
Joe!

00:19:42.840 --> 00:19:44.360
Nishi!

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:54.750
Joe cried...

00:19:56.870 --> 00:20:01.250
Joe cried for me!

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:11.230
You did it!

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:13.230
You did it, Nishi!

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:28.940
You son of a bitch!

00:20:28.940 --> 00:20:32.710
You dirty, worthless son of a bitch!

00:20:39.060 --> 00:20:40.710
Congratulations, Nishi-kun!

00:20:41.620 --> 00:20:42.720
N-Noriko?

00:20:43.830 --> 00:20:48.630
I actually came to see all your matches in secret.

00:20:48.630 --> 00:20:52.370
Y-You did? Well, thank you...

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:56.720
But it was too painful to see you when you were down on yourself for losing.

00:20:56.720 --> 00:20:57.690
So, I...

00:20:57.690 --> 00:20:59.080
Noriko...

00:20:59.080 --> 00:21:02.690
Y-You're so considerate...

00:21:02.690 --> 00:21:06.200
Hey, stop pushing! You're gonna blow our cover!

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:11.700
It's that red shawl and neckerchief!

00:21:13.110 --> 00:21:15.060
Hey! Hide him! Otherwise, he'll figure it out!

00:21:15.060 --> 00:21:16.370
Come on! Hide him!

00:21:18.360 --> 00:21:21.090
Nothing to see here!

00:21:21.090 --> 00:21:23.240
That's a cruel thing to say!

00:21:23.240 --> 00:21:24.170
Shut up!

00:21:25.060 --> 00:21:26.420
A ghost!

00:21:37.450 --> 00:21:38.230
Joe...

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:43.420
Nishi...

00:21:43.420 --> 00:21:44.700
Or should I say, Mammoth Nishi...

00:21:46.180 --> 00:21:47.310
Thank you.

00:21:47.310 --> 00:21:48.740
I won thanks to you, Joe.

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:51.420
Hey, old man.

00:21:51.420 --> 00:21:54.940
Now we can cross that one off his list of goals.

00:22:05.470 --> 00:22:07.720
I really made you worry, old man, Joe.

00:22:09.000 --> 00:22:10.740
Forget it.

00:22:10.740 --> 00:22:11.560
Take this, Nishi!

00:23:07.470 --> 00:23:07.950
Now...

00:23:08.710 --> 00:23:10.870
The man who stands in front of Joe...

00:23:10.870 --> 00:23:14.070
is a mighty man aiming at competing in the World Championships, Wolf Kanagushi!

00:23:17.010 --> 00:23:18.990
Wolf's eyes are ablaze.

00:23:18.990 --> 00:23:21.570
They burn whitish-blue like a snake's.

00:23:21.570 --> 00:23:25.220
He lies in wait for Joe, with his fangs bared!

00:23:26.070 --> 00:23:30.540
Sparks are starting to fly in Joe and Wolf's showdown,

00:23:30.540 --> 00:23:32.970
and a formidable battle is about to begin!

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:35.970
Joe!

00:23:36.480 --> 00:23:41.150
You'll get your first shot at Rikiishi once you defeat Wolf!

00:23:41.150 --> 00:23:42.220
But...

00:23:42.710 --> 00:23:45.180
If Wolf's fangs clamp down on you...

00:23:45.180 --> 00:23:46.000
Joe...

00:23:47.970 --> 00:23:52.160
Your glory and your tomorrow will evaporate like morning dew!

00:23:52.910 --> 00:23:56.410
You will have to live as a stray dog... as a loser!

00:23:57.090 --> 00:24:02.130
Now, for Joe, whose next opponent is his greatest foe,

00:24:02.130 --> 00:24:04.130
which way is tomorrow!?
